### Plots API

### List all plots
GET http://localhost:8080/plots
Accept: application/json

### Get plot by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/plots/1
Accept: application/json

### Create plot
POST http://localhost:8080/plots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "width": 10,
  "height": 5
}

### Update plot (careful: removes garden and vegetables, see next slide)
PUT http://localhost:8080/plots/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "width": 12,
  "height": 7
}

### Delete plot
DELETE http://localhost:8080/plots/1
